ind":"announcement","title":"Retromine Next Fest Demo Announcement!","summary":"Retromine is available during Steam Next Fest this week, the biggest demo event of the year!Thank you so much for all of your positive feedback on v5.0, and for all the comments, posts, & bug reports. I'm feeling very motivated again, and I'm getting ready to finish the game for you all in early 2027.I hope you all have a great time trying out demos during Next Fest!⛏️ Play here:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:04:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692033","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4061320-1846651706679583","game_id":"steam-4061320","kind":"announcement","title":"Retromine Demo v5.0 is OUT NOW!","summary":"Retromine Demo v5.0 Patch Notes Retropedia, Draw Tokens, Reworks Galore, Fan Feedback & More! Demo v5.0!Hi everyone! I know I promised that the last update would be the last free update before the full release. Wellllllll, oops. I decided to release one more update, ahead of Retromine’s appearance in the Steam Next Fest on Monday! As such, this is a smaller update than usual. It adds Retropedia, an in-game wiki tool, a new mechanic that replaces the hand cap, several power & card reworks, and a ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T23:31:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679583","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4061320-1839041357027807","game_id":"steam-4061320","kind":"update","title":"Retromine Demo 4.0 Hotfix Patch","summary":"Demo 4.0 Hotfix PatchHi everyone,Today is a minor patch that fixes a few bugs with the initial demo release, including:Bug FixesFixed 